## 📂 Project Structure

```
MIRA-Windows/
│
├── agent/                        # LLM orchestration layer
MIRA-Windows/
│
├── agent/                        # LLM orchestration layer
│   └── model_adapter.py          # 5-provider fallback chain (Groq, Gemini, Cerebras, etc.)
│
├── mcp_server/                   # Tool connectivity layer
│   ├── connectors/               # Core tool implementations
│   │   ├── contacts.py           # CRM/Contact management [NEW]
│   │   ├── knowledge.py          # RAG/Knowledge base [NEW]
│   │   ├── calendar.py           # Includes autonomous scheduler support
│   │   └── plugin_tools.py       # Plugin management [NEW]
│   ├── plugin_manager.py         # Plugin lifecycle system [NEW]
│   └── db.sqlite                 # Core SQLite DB (events, contacts)
│
├── plugins/                      # Dynamic extensions directory
│   └── (plugin_folders)/         # Each with plugin.yaml + main.py
│
├── scheduler/                    # Real-time background services
│   └── autonomous_scheduler.py   # Monitors DB for voice notifications [NEW]
│
├── ui/                           # Web interface
│   └── templates/chat.html       # Reactive streaming UI
│
├── voice/                        # Voice interaction (Whisper/Piper)
│
├── SANDBOX/                      # SECURE workspace for agent files [NEW]
│
├── pyproject.toml                # Unified package structure [PEP 517]
├── requirements.txt              # Unified dependencies
└── run.bat                       # Launch MCP + UI + Scheduler
```

