**Backend**: SQLite database ([todos.db](file:///C:/Users/lenovo/Downloads/MIRA-Deliverables/MIRA-Windows/todos.db)) with schema:
```sql
CREATE TABLE tasks (
    id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,
    task TEXT NOT NULL,
    priority TEXT DEFAULT 'medium',
    due_date TEXT,
    completed INTEGER DEFAULT 0,
    created_at TEXT DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
)
```

### 5. ⚙️ System & Environment Control

**Connector**: [mcp_server/connectors/system.py](file:///C:/Users/lenovo/Downloads/MIRA-Deliverables/MIRA-Windows/mcp_server/connectors/system.py)

| Tool | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `system.shell` | Run whitelisted PowerShell commands (SANDBOX only) |
| `system.time` | Get current date/time |
| `system.clipboard.read` | Read clipboard contents |
| `system.clipboard.write` | Write to clipboard |

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Security**: `system.shell` only allows whitelisted read-only commands (dir, echo, type, etc.) and executes them in the SANDBOX directory. Write operations, script execution, and network commands are blocked.

**Connector**: [mcp_server/connectors/filesystem.py](file:///C:/Users/lenovo/Downloads/MIRA-Deliverables/MIRA-Windows/mcp_server/connectors/filesystem.py)

| Tool | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `filesystem.read` | Read file contents (SANDBOX only) |
| `filesystem.write` | Write to files (SANDBOX only) |
| `filesystem.append` | Append to files (SANDBOX only) |
| `filesystem.list` | List directory contents (SANDBOX only) |
| `filesystem.search` | Recursive file search (SANDBOX only) |

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Security**: ALL filesystem operations are restricted to the `SANDBOX/` directory only. The agent cannot access `.env`, source code, or system files.

